// ============================================================
// CENTRAL PROCUREMENT SYSTEM
// 2026 ATI PROCUREMENT MONITORING
//
// CENTRAL RESPONSIBILITY:
//
// 1. Purchase Order numbers
// 2. BAC Resolution numbers
// 3. Contract numbers
//
// PROCESSING ORDER:
//
// PO
//   ↓
// BAC RES
//   ↓
// CONTRACT
//
// ============================================================
//
// IMPORTANT GROUP CONTROL RULE:
//
// The control number belongs to the FIRST ROW of each
// procurement group.
//
// PO       → AR
// BAC RES  → AQ
// CONTRACT → AR
//
// PROCESS:
//
// 1. Validate required/vital data.
// 2. Check if the procurement group already has a control
//    number in LEAN.
//       → YES = SKIP ENTIRE GROUP.
// 3. If LEAN control number is blank, search the CENTRAL
//    sheet for an exact matching procurement.
//       → MATCH = DO NOT WRITE TO CENTRAL.
//                 Copy existing control number to the
//                 FIRST ROW of LEAN.
// 4. If no CENTRAL match:
//       → Generate new control number.
//       → Write new record to CENTRAL.
//       → Write control number to FIRST ROW of LEAN.
//
// ============================================================


